// Direct verification probe for `compiler.build.manifest` and `compiler.build.workspace`
// (T851 / E20.1: SPEC-110 §§1..3 & §5, REQ-PKG-022, REQ-PKG-024, REQ-PKG-025, INV-BLD-001).

module main

